&FORCE_EVAL
   METHOD QUICKSTEP
   &SUBSYS
      &KIND N
         BASIS_SET QZVPP-MOLOPT-PBE-ae
         POTENTIAL ALL
         RADIAL_GRID 100
         LEBEDEV_GRID 434
