         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.0
      &END KIND
      &KIND C
         BASIS_SET QZVPP-MOLOPT-PBE-ae
         POTENTIAL ALL
         RADIAL_GRID 100
         LEBEDEV_GRID 434
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.52
      &END KIND
      &TOPOLOGY
         &CENTER_COORDINATES
         &END CENTER_COORDINATES
      &END TOPOLOGY
      &COORD
         H       -1.9683600020        1.0670700018        1.3430700014
